tarred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T05:17:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T05:17:44Z","body":"@sockeye-d There's no reference being held to it anywhere else in the app, though - shouldn't it still be reaped because it's unreachable?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765148316/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765199838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120526#issuecomment-4765199838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120526","id":4765199838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHAct3g","user":{"login":"bennbollay","id":3607121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDcxMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3607121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay","html_url":"https://github.com/bennbollay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bennbollay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T05:28:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T05:28:50Z","body":"> RefCounted instances caught in a cyclic reference will not be freed automatically. For example, if a node holds a reference to instance A, which directly or indirectly holds a reference back to A, A's reference count will be 2. Destruction of the node will leave A dangling with a reference count of 1, and there will be a memory leak. To prevent this, one of the references in the cycle can be made weak with [@GlobalScope.weakref()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_%40globalscope.html#class-globalscope-method-weakref).\n\n[RefCounted Documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_refcounted.html#description)\n\nOkay, just running into a run-of-the-mill circular ref loop.\n\nThanks @sockeye-d!  Closing this ticket.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765199838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]